#==============================================================================================
#
#   toggle_event - HTML::ToggleEvent: the beforetoggle and toggle events of details, dialog
#                  and popovers
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/ToggleEvent.cpp (lines 1-51) and ToggleEvent.h (lines
#       1-57): an Event carrying the old and new states and the element that caused the
#       toggle. The prototype (WEB_SET_PROTOTYPE_FOR_INTERFACE) waits for the bindings (P3).
